      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Oliveira et al.",
        "AbstractText": "The facultative plant pathogen Epicoccum sorghinum is associated with grain mold of sorghum and produces the mycotoxin tenuazonic acid. This fungus can have serious economic impact on sorghum production. Here, we report the draft genome sequence of E. sorghinum (USPMTOX48)."
